  ('TL1-03','Risk Management, Group Management, Core Competencies',1,'Tongariro','2024, version 9','Scope Prerequisites This competency is required for any instructor leading groups • 20 personal days in a variety of disciplines in the normal local operating area under supervision of the • 10 days experience as a leader in the Duty Manager. outdoors Recorded Recognition of Current Competence Assessment • Observations should be done during initial 2 Years Prior Industry Experience or Tertiary Diploma level 5 or training period for all new staff above + Induction into the Hillary Outdoors Policy’s. • Discussion and observation by a Senior Instructor for at least one of the observations, Any NZOIA Level 1 or above + Induction into Hillary Outdoors Outdoor Instructor for the other. Policy’s. • Assessment to be at 2 sites or activities • Consider use of Questions 1-7 from the NZOIA Core Knowledge Workbook fleS eti 1 S sessa 2 etiS ssessa Knowledge an instructor must have an understanding of:','{"self": "Self", "assess1": "Assess site 1", "assess2": "Assess site 2"}',2,true),
  ('TL1-05','Communications',1,'Tongariro','2024, version 9','Scope Prerequisites This competency is compulsory for all persons who have sole None. charge of students. Recorded Recognition of Current Competence Assessment None. • Observations should be done during initial training period for all new staff • Assessment through discussion and observation by an Outdoor Instructor or higher G In e or n de e r r t a o l c o K m n p o le w te l t e hi d s c g o e m petency an instructor must:','{"self": "Self", "obs1": "Obs", "obs2": "Obs", "assess1": "Assessor"}',1,true),
