  ('TL3-07','Sea Kayak',3,'Tongariro','2024, version 9','Scope Training and Assessment Path The holder of this qualification can organise and instruct Training must be done before assessment, not together overnight Sea Kayaking trips on open water areas where Observation can be done by an instructor with L2 sea adverse conditions and limited periods of exposed coast may kayak be encountered. Assessor must hold NZOIA Sea Kayak 2 or NZOIA Sea Adverse conditions being; wind up to 15 knots and swell of up Kayak 1 with local knowledge and training department to 1 metre. approval or hold this internal sign off with training The competency also allows the instructor to lead an department approval. expedition on grade 1. An example of a trip would be to Te Hapua Bay to camp or a Assessment is by direct observation Delta trip on the Tongariro River. Prerequisites Recorded Recognition of Current L1 Sea Kayak Competence: L1 Camp • NZOIA Sea Kayak 1 with local famil No less than 15 days sea kayaking, to include: • Or NZOIA Seak Kayak 2 No less than 10 days co-instructing or instructing A S elf O b s 1 O b s 2 ssesso r SMS Activity management plan has been read and signed','{"self": "Self", "obs1": "Obs 1", "obs2": "Obs 2", "assess1": "Assessor"}',1,false),
  ('TL3-11','Canoe class 1+',3,'Tongariro','2024, Version 9','Scope Training and Assessment Path With this competency an instructor can organise and lead and teach Training can be done by an instructor with L2 Canoe progressions to effectively lead a trip on class 1+ water. and TM approval. The instructor should be able to assist on a Whanganui River Assessor must hold Level 3 including NZOIA Canoe1 expedition with the class 2 endorsement or equivalent. Sites within the scope may include:  Motuoapa to Stump Bay circuit Assessment is by direct observation  Lower Delta to Tokaanu  Te Hapua Bay  Just outside L2 scope: Tongariro from Major Jones to SH1 Prerequisites Recorded Recognition of Current L1 Canoe Competence: L1 River Safety • Logged White Water and Canoe L1 Camping Experience 5 trips on moving water • NZOIA Canoe 1 to include 3 sessions of at least 2 hours duration instructing to the scope of this award including teaching moving water progressions 2 overnight camping trips with canoes A Site: s elf O b s 1 O b s 2 ssesso r Technical Competence 1. Demonstrate and describe the care and appropriate use of canoeing gear','{"self": "Self", "obs1": "Obs 1", "obs2": "Obs 2", "assess1": "Assessor"}',1,false),
